       IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
       PROGRAM-ID. MOVEALIAS.
       DATA DIVISION.
       WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
       01 SOURCE-TEXT PIC X(4) VALUE 'ABCD'.
       01 TARGET-VIEW REDEFINES SOURCE-TEXT PIC X(2) JUSTIFIED RIGHT.
       01 RESULT-TEXT PIC X(4).
       PROCEDURE DIVISION.
           MOVE SOURCE-TEXT TO TARGET-VIEW RESULT-TEXT
           DISPLAY 'SOURCE:' SOURCE-TEXT
           DISPLAY 'RESULT:' RESULT-TEXT
           GOBACK.
